{"id":"00319","root":"uni00319_1","name":{"ja":"死々村　孤路","en":"Shishimura Koro"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"死々村　孤路","en":"Shishimura Koro"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-04-15","limited":false,"characterId":213,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。五車学園の学生対魔忍。五車風紀隊に所属しており、隊長の穂稀なおとは幼馴染。一見根暗そうな隠れ美人で、実は話し好きだが、声が小さ過ぎて無口だと思われている。親友の穂稀なおにだけは何故か彼女の声が聞きとれるらしい。魂遁の術“黄泉録り”の使い手で、死体に触れて霊魂の情報を読み取る。霊魂の情報とは、死因や遺伝情報といった科学的情報の他、強く残っている思念、記憶といったもの。まさに五車のスーパー監察医である。ただし深い情報を得るには集中して長い時間、死体に触れている必要があり、また死体が欠損していると得られる情報も比例して減る。生きている人間から情報を読み取る事は出来ないが、切り離された部位、例えば髪の毛などが生命力を失えば、そこから読み取る事はできる。その場合もやはり、得られる情報の量は切り離された部位の大きさに比例する。逸刀流の剣士でもあり、居合使いとして一流の腕前を持つ。霊魂の手で超高速居合をしているとの噂もあるが、真偽は定かではない。","en":"Shishimura Koro is a Taimanin and student at Gosha Academy. She belongs to the Gosha Discipline Squad, and the squad leader, Homare Nao, is her childhood friend. She appears as a gloomy, hidden beauty, but she's actually talkative; her voice is so soft that people assume she's taciturn. For some reason, Homare Nao alone can hear her clearly. Koro wields the soul-stealing technique \"Yomi-roku,\" allowing her to touch corpses and read the spirits' information—ranging from cause of death and genetic data to lingering thoughts and memories. She's essentially Gosha's super forensic doctor. However, extracting deep information requires prolonged concentration, and missing body parts reduce the data she can obtain. She cannot read living humans, but if a detached part—like a strand of hair—loses its life force, she can extract information proportionally to its size. She is also a master of the Ittō style, a top-tier iaijutsu swordsman. Rumors claim she performs ultra-fast iaijutsu with a spirit-hand, though the truth remains uncertain."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"いねむりすやこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00319_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1242,2484],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[186,372],"def":[121,242],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","550004"]},{"id":"uni00319_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1884,3768],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[297,594],"def":[167,334],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","550004","550005"]},{"id":"uni00319_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2526,5063],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[408,818],"def":[213,427],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","550004","550005","550006"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"}]},"550004":{"slot":"skill1","id":550004,"name":{"ja":"逸刀流・居合"},"hits":5,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 117% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"}]},"550005":{"slot":"skill2","id":550005,"name":{"ja":"逸刀流“死屍累々”"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体を高確率で封印状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":245,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体を高確率で封印状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":240,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体を高確率で封印状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":235,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体を高確率で封印状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体を高確率で封印状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 50% chance to inflict Seal for 3 turns","icon":"seal","tag":"ailment"}]},"550006":{"slot":"ultimate","id":550006,"name":{"ja":"魂遁の術“黄泉録り”"},"hits":4,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":330,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、このスキルによる攻撃のみ超特大確率で会心が発生する"}},{"level":2,"sp":330,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃